@* THE STORY: the home page runs in order, Dallas → leaving home → Austin → home (wwwroot/css/story.css, wwwroot/js/story.js).
   Each chapter is data: where and when, one line, a short narration in "she", and its numbers.
   Every number names where it comes from (Source, and Href to fly to the proof) and its thread:
   people = I understand people, make = I make things, start = I tend to start things (the same three as "01 / 02 / 03" in Home).
   Count = what it counts up to on screen (null for numbers that shouldn't count, like 7:35 AM).
   Music numbers come from Heavy Rotation's export (listening-history/etl/galaxy_export.py), never typed from memory. *@
